WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.587
By the numbers, the scale of institutional failure is staggering.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:09.462
An independent review documented over 4,000 complaints backlogged.

00:00:09.462 --> 00:00:15.450
A persistent pattern of buried recommendations proves the institution cannot reform itself.
